{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-hashmi-kajal-eyeliner-2607-0193","content_id":"7ff3626a-7d1f-4f97-b864-7a466de571ad","description":"Product Recall for Hashmi Kajal Eyeliner presenting a serious chemical risk.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"1c780720-9121-4087-9efe-05ce2f32bbcb","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-10T17:19:08+01:00","id":"1c780720-9121-4087-9efe-05ce2f32bbcb","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-10T17:19:08+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a79f9fc9fad0e27bebabec0/2607-0193-product-recall-hashmi-kajal.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Hashmi Kajal Eyeliner</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as it contains mercury, cadmium, arsenic and lead, which are prohibited for use in cosmetic products.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: OPSS published a Product Safety Report for this product on the 29th July 2026. The business (Hallan Cash &amp; Carry) has subsequently voluntarily recalled the product from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics, personal care and grooming - Cosmetic/Make Up - Eyes</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Hashmi</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>A.Q &amp; Company</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>8961100314003</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Identifiers</td>\n      <td>B. No. B/11-141/J, Mg 09/2023, Best Before 08/2028</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Pakistan</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Cosmetic product intended to be applied around the eyes. 4.5g tube of firm black paste packaged in a card and plastic bubble pack.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_1c780720-9121-4087-9efe-05ce2f32bbcb\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a79f9fc9fad0e27bebabec0/2607-0193-product-recall-hashmi-kajal.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk as it contains mercury, cadmium, arsenic and lead. These chemicals are prohibited for use in cosmetic products.</p>\n\n<p>Further information on the health effects of mercury, cadmium, arsenic and lead exposure can be accessed on GOV.UK at the following links:  </p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/mercury-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology/mercury-general-information\">Mercury: general information - GOV.UK</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/cadmium-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology\">Cadmium: general information - GOV.UK</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/lead-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology\">Lead: general information - GOV UK</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/arsenic-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology/arsenic-general-information\">Arsenic: general information – GOV UK</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of Regulation (EC) 1223/2009 (‘The Cosmetics Regulation’).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>OPSS published a Product Safety Report for this product on the 29th July 2026. The business (Hallan Cash &amp; Carry) has subsequently voluntarily recalled the product from end users.</p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product and return it to Hallan Cash &amp; Carry for a full refund.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2607-0193</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Updating published summary to recall. ","public_timestamp":"2026-08-10T16:19:48Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-29T09:22:18Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-29","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-07-29T10:22:18+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-hashmi-kajal-eyeliner-2607-0193","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-hashmi-kajal-eyeliner-2607-0193","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-hashmi-kajal-eyeliner-2607-0193","content_id":"7ff3626a-7d1f-4f97-b864-7a466de571ad","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-10T16:19:48Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Hashmi Kajal Eyeliner (2607-0193)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-hashmi-kajal-eyeliner-2607-0193","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":